zinc_pseudo.py and AD4Zn.dat are copied from AutoDock Vina
(https://github.com/ccsb-scripps/AutoDock-Vina, commit 3c65c0b3e6c2c1d183f6a175ecb65e3c5ba91645:
example/autodock_scripts/zinc_pseudo.py and data/AD4Zn.dat).

zinc_pseudo.py is distributed under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this directory). It is
modified: load_pdbqt() takes lines as well as a filename, the body of main() moved to
add_pseudo_atoms() so it can run in process, and main() only runs as a script. The output is
unchanged.

AD4Zn.dat is unmodified and keeps its own header: AutoDock, Copyright (C) 1989-2007 Garrett M.
Morris, David S. Goodsell, Ruth Huey, Arthur J. Olson, GNU General Public License version 2 or
(at your option) any later version (GPL-2.0 in this directory). It is a parameter file that
AutoGrid/AutoDock read at run time; no code in this package is derived from it.

AutoDock4Zn force field: Santos-Martins D. et al., J. Chem. Inf. Model. 2014, 54, 2371-2379.
